{"seq":2,"slug":"multimodal-transformers","title":"多模态 Transformer：统一视觉、语言与音频的表征空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/nlp-transformers/applications/multimodal-transformers","wordCount":1275,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"多模态-transformer-统一视觉-语言与音频的表征空间\">多模态 Transformer：统一视觉、语言与音频的表征空间</h1><p>2026 年的 AI 系统不再局限于纯文本——GPT-4o 实时处理语音对话，Gemini 2.0 理解长视频，Claude 4 分析复杂图表，MiniMax M3 原生支持文本、图像和视频输入。这些能力的技术基础是多模态 Transformer：将不同模态的信息映射到统一的表征空间，让同一个注意力机制跨模态建立关联。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>多模态 Transformer 的关键挑战是如何将视觉、音频等非文本信号转化为 Transformer 可处理的 token 序列。主流方案是通过模态特定的编码器将原始信号压缩为一组&quot;视觉 token&quot;或&quot;音频 token&quot;，与文本 token 拼接后送入统一的 Transformer 骨干网络。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    IMG[图像/视频] --&gt; VE[视觉编码器 ViT/SigLIP]&#10;    AUD[音频] --&gt; AE[音频编码器 Whisper]&#10;    TXT[文本] --&gt; TE[文本 Tokenizer]&#10;    VE --&gt; PROJ1[投影层]&#10;    AE --&gt; PROJ2[投影层]&#10;    TE --&gt; EMB[嵌入层]&#10;    PROJ1 --&gt; CONCAT[Token 序列拼接]&#10;    PROJ2 --&gt; CONCAT&#10;    EMB --&gt; CONCAT&#10;    CONCAT --&gt; TF[统一 Transformer 骨干]&#10;    TF --&gt; OUT[多模态输出]\">graph TD\n    IMG[图像/视频] --&gt; VE[视觉编码器 ViT/SigLIP]\n    AUD[音频] --&gt; AE[音频编码器 Whisper]\n    TXT[文本] --&gt; TE[文本 Tokenizer]\n    VE --&gt; PROJ1[投影层]\n    AE --&gt; PROJ2[投影层]\n    TE --&gt; EMB[嵌入层]\n    PROJ1 --&gt; CONCAT[Token 序列拼接]\n    PROJ2 --&gt; CONCAT\n    EMB --&gt; CONCAT\n    CONCAT --&gt; TF[统一 Transformer 骨干]\n    TF --&gt; OUT[多模态输出]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>架构模式</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>代表模型</th>\n<th>优劣</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Encoder-Fusion</td>\n<td>冻结视觉编码器 + 适配层 + LLM</td>\n<td>LLaVA, InternVL</td>\n<td>训练高效，依赖视觉编码器质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Early Fusion</td>\n<td>从 step 0 联合训练所有模态</td>\n<td>Gemini, MiniMax M3</td>\n<td>模态交互最深，训练成本极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cross-Attention</td>\n<td>视觉特征通过交叉注意力注入 LLM</td>\n<td>Flamingo, Idefics</td>\n<td>模块化强，但信息传递有瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Token Interleaving</td>\n<td>视觉/音频 token 与文本 token 交错排列</td>\n<td>GPT-4o, Qwen-VL2</td>\n<td>灵活处理混合输入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"视觉编码器-从-vit-到动态分辨率\">视觉编码器：从 ViT 到动态分辨率</h2><p>Vision Transformer（ViT）将图像切分为固定大小的 patch（通常 14x14 或 16x16 像素），每个 patch 线性投影后作为一个视觉 token。一张 224x224 的图像产生 196 个 token，一张 1024x1024 的图像产生 4096 个 token。</p>\n<p>2025-2026 年的关键进展是<strong>动态分辨率</strong>处理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>NaViT（Native Resolution ViT）</strong>：直接处理任意分辨率图像，无需 resize 或 padding</li>\n<li><strong>Tile-based Processing</strong>：将高分辨率图像切成多个标准 tile，分别编码后拼接</li>\n<li><strong>Token Merging/Pruning</strong>：动态合并或裁剪冗余视觉 token，控制序列长度</li>\n</ul>\n<p>MiniMax M3 的视觉编码器仅 600M 参数，但通过与 428B 主模型的深度融合（从训练第一步即联合优化），实现了强大的视觉理解能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"音频与语音-流式多模态交互\">音频与语音：流式多模态交互</h2><p>GPT-4o 展示的实时语音对话能力背后是<strong>端到端语音 Transformer</strong>：</p>\n<p>传统管线：语音 → ASR 转录 → 文本 LLM → TTS 合成 → 语音输出</p>\n<p>端到端方案：语音 → 语音 token → 多模态 Transformer → 语音/文本 token → 输出</p>\n<p>端到端方案的优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>保留语音中的韵律、情感、语速等副语言信息</li>\n<li>延迟从秒级降到百毫秒级（消除 ASR/TTS 环节）</li>\n<li>能处理非语言声音（笑声、停顿、环境音）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>核心技术是<strong>语音离散化</strong>——通过声学 tokenizer（如 EnCodec、SpeechTokenizer）将连续音频波形压缩为离散 token 序列，使其与文本 token 在同一空间中处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"视频理解-时序建模的挑战\">视频理解：时序建模的挑战</h2><p>视频比图像多出时间维度，带来 token 数量爆炸问题。一段 1 分钟、30fps 的视频包含 1800 帧，若每帧产生 196 个视觉 token，总计 352,800 个 token——远超大多数模型的上下文窗口。</p>\n<p>2026 年的解决方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>Token 数</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>均匀采样</td>\n<td>每 N 帧取 1 帧</td>\n<td>低（~200-1000）</td>\n<td>简单视频问答</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键帧提取</td>\n<td>场景变化检测</td>\n<td>中（~500-2000）</td>\n<td>事件定位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时空压缩</td>\n<td>3D 卷积 + 时序池化</td>\n<td>中（~1000-5000）</td>\n<td>动作识别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全帧长上下文</td>\n<td>1M token 模型</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>长视频深度理解</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>MiniMax M3 利用其 1M token 上下文窗口，能处理长达 8 小时以上的视频内容——这是 MoE + 稀疏注意力 + 长上下文三项技术融合的体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多模态对齐训练\">多模态对齐训练</h2><p>让不同模态在同一空间中&quot;说同一种语言&quot;需要专门的对齐训练：</p>\n<p><strong>CLIP 范式（对比学习）</strong>：最大化匹配的图文对相似度，最小化不匹配对的相似度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>CLIP</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{CLIP}} = -\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\log\\frac{e^{\\text{sim}(v_i, t_i)/\\tau}}{\\sum_{j=1}^{N} e^{\\text{sim}(v_i, t_j)/\\tau}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CLIP</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1354em;vertical-align:-1.307em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.565em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1288em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8301em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.0051em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.307em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>生成式对齐</strong>：直接让模型在交错的多模态序列上做 next-token prediction，通过预测&quot;图像 token 后面跟什么文本&quot;和&quot;文本 token 后面跟什么图像&quot;来隐式学习跨模态对应关系。</p>\n<p>MiniMax M3 采用后者——从 step 0 在 ~100T 交错的文本-图像-视频 token 上联合训练，实现了最深度的模态融合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>多模态 Transformer 的核心是将所有模态统一为 token 序列，共享注意力机制</li>\n<li>Early Fusion 质量最高但训练成本极其昂贵；Encoder-Fusion 是性价比更高的选择</li>\n<li>视频理解的瓶颈在于 token 数量，需要结合长上下文技术和时序压缩</li>\n<li>2026 年&quot;原生多模态&quot;（从训练开始即联合所有模态）成为顶级模型的标配</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章前一篇 <a href=\"retrieval-augmented-generation\">检索增强生成</a>展示多模态 RAG 如何检索图像和视频</li>\n<li>本章下一篇 <a href=\"long-context-modeling\">长上下文建模</a>解释支撑百万 token 视频理解的底层技术</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../graph-neural-networks/applications/recommender-knowledge-graphs\">图神经网络在推荐系统中的应用</a>展示知识图谱如何增强多模态内容理解</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多模态 Transformer：统一视觉、语言与音频的表征空间","id":"多模态-transformer-统一视觉-语言与音频的表征空间"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"视觉编码器：从 ViT 到动态分辨率","id":"视觉编码器-从-vit-到动态分辨率"},{"level":2,"text":"音频与语音：流式多模态交互","id":"音频与语音-流式多模态交互"},{"level":2,"text":"视频理解：时序建模的挑战","id":"视频理解-时序建模的挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"多模态对齐训练","id":"多模态对齐训练"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"检索增强生成：让模型接入外部知识","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/nlp-transformers/applications/retrieval-augmented-generation"},"next":{"title":"长上下文建模：突破序列长度的物理限制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/nlp-transformers/applications/long-context-modeling"}}